tx.sign(buyer_private_key)

// Send transaction to Bitcoin network
send_to_network(tx)
```
Note that this pseudocode assumes that the buyer and seller have already agreed on the terms of the transaction and the amount of Bitcoin to be exchanged. The escrow node is selected using the puzzle scheme I described earlier, and the parties use a shared secret value and a puzzle solution to ensure that the transaction is secure and verifiable.

