    }
}
```
Note that in this implementation, we assume that `N` is the size of the sliding window, `base` is the sequence number of the oldest unacknowledged packet, and `nextseqnum` is the sequence number of the next packet to be sent. We also assume that the `buffer` is an array of packets with size `N`.

