Overall, using NextAuth to control access to resources in your quiz website builder is a straightforward process that involves setting up your authentication providers, adding the NextAuth middleware to your server, and using the `withAuth` HOC to protect routes or resources. You can refer to the NextAuth documentation for more detailed instructions and examples.

